<%- include('partials/header', {title:'FindIt — Lost & Found'}) %>
<section class="hero-section"><div class="hero-copy"><span class="eyebrow light">A COMMUNITY THAT LOOKS OUT FOR YOU</span><h1>Lost something?<br><span>Let's find it.</span></h1><p>One simple place to report missing belongings, share found items and reconnect people with what matters.</p><div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2"><a href="/items/new" class="btn btn-light btn-lg rounded-pill px-4">Report an item <span>↗</span></a><a href="/items" class="btn btn-outline-light btn-lg rounded-pill px-4">Browse listings</a></div><div class="hero-proof"><span>✓ Free community platform</span><span>✓ Simple and secure</span></div></div><div class="hero-art"><div class="orbit orbit-one"></div><div class="orbit orbit-two"></div><div class="hero-icon">⌕</div><div class="floating-note note-one"> <b>Found!</b><small>Keys near the library</small></div><div class="floating-note note-two"><b>Reunited ♥</b><small>A little good news</small></div><div class="hero-spark">✦</div></div></section>
<section class="stats-strip"><div><strong><%= totals.lost %></strong><span>Active lost reports</span></div><div><strong><%= totals.found %></strong><span>Found items shared</span></div><div><strong><%= totals.returned %></strong><span>Items returned</span></div></section>
<section class="section-block"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">GET STARTED</span><h2>Every item deserves<br>a way back home.</h2></div><p>Share a clear report and let your community help make the connection.</p></div><div class="row g-3"><div class="col-md-6"><a class="action-panel lost-panel" href="/items/new"><span class="action-icon">↗</span><span class="eyebrow">CAN'T FIND IT?</span><h3>Report a lost item</h3><p>Tell the community what went missing and where you last saw it.</p><b>Start a lost report →</b></a></div><div class="col-md-6"><a class="action-panel found-panel" href="/items/new"><span class="action-icon">✦</span><span class="eyebrow">FOUND SOMETHING?</span><h3>Report a found item</h3><p>Help someone recover their belongings by sharing what you found.</p><b>Share a found item →</b></a></div></div></section>
<section class="section-block pt-0"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">RECENT ACTIVITY</span><h2>Latest community reports</h2></div><a href="/items" class="text-link">Explore all items →</a></div><div class="row g-4"><% if (latestItems.length) { %><% latestItems.forEach(item => { %><div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4"><%- include('partials/item-card', {item}) %></div><% }) %><% } else { %><div class="empty-state">No reports yet. Be the first to share an item.</div><% } %></div></section>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
